Welcome to our CivicWeb Portal!
The Township of Addington Highlands endeavours to keep the community engaged with what is going on within our municipality. We are pleased to introduce our CivicWeb Portal. The portal increases transparency by enabling our citizens to learn about meetings, search for documents, view reports, and more!
 Within our Portal, you can:
Search for documents in our online library
Subscribe to meetings that interest you
View upcoming and past meetings using the Calendar
Review agendas and minutes within the Meeting area
