Accessible Websites and Documents
The Township of Alnwick/Haldimand is committed to providing accessible services and documents to our residents and visitors. The Township will ensure that the official municipal website and web content conforms to the World Wide Consortium Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.0, Level A, at a minimum, except where meeting this requirement is not practical. 
If you are having any issues accessing information on the website, please contact the Municipal Clerk's Office at clerks@ahtwp.ca or 905-349-2822. We cannot guarantee the accessibility of third-party documents or websites.
Request Information in an Accessible Format
Information and communications can be shared in many ways. To request municipal information in an accessible format, please contact clerks@ahtwp.ca or 905-349-2822 ext 32.
Disclaimer: The information provided on the Township of Alnwick/Haldimand's Council Portal is provided for informational purposes only. To verify the accuracy and currency of this information or to request a certified true copy of a document, please email the Municipal Clerk's Office at clerks@ahtwp.ca or 905-349-2822 ext 32.
