 10.1
Memo to Council 2026-038
 Updated Planning Report for Consent Application B02-2026 and Zoning By-Law Amendment Application Z15-2026 423365 25 Sideroad
Recommended Motion:
BE IT RESOLVED THAT:
Consent Application B02-2026 for lands legally described as Part of Lot 26, Concession 8, Township of Amaranth, County of Dufferin, be granted conditional approval subject to the following:
That the Owner pays taxes in full.
That the draft reference plan be prepared by an Ontario Land Surveyor and that the plan be approved by the Township prior to being deposited with the Land Registry Office. That a copy of the registered reference plan be provided to the Township in digital and paper format.
That the Owner obtain approval of a Zoning By-law Amendment to restrict future residential dwellings from being constructed on the retained parcel.
That the Owner convey any required road widenings to the Township.
That the Owner pay the parkland dedication fee.
That any road widening, survey costs, legal costs, any other transactions pertaining to the application be borne by the applicant.
That all conditions be fulfilled, and certificate of clerk issued within two years of the date of notice of decision where failure to do so will cause the application to be invalid.
