RPT-0349-26 - Local Board Remuneration – O.P.P. Detachment Board - H. Boyd
 Recommendation

THAT Staff Report RPT-0349-26 “Local Board Remuneration – O.P.P. Detachment Board” be received as information;

THAT the following remuneration schedule for members of the County of Brant O.P.P. Detachment Board be set as follows:
Citizen Appointees to the O.P.P. Detachment Board        $4,750/year
Additional Remuneration for Chair                                   $1,000/year

THAT this remuneration be paid quarterly, in arrears, inclusive of all duties, including but not limited to meeting preparation, attendance, governance work and conference / training attendance;

THAT where Council approves an across-the-board increase to the County’s non-union salaries, this increase shall apply to the remuneration for citizen appointees to the O.P.P. Detachment Board;

THAT members of the O.P.P. Detachment Board be eligible for reimbursement for use of a personal vehicle for distances travelled on Board business at the rate approved for the County of Brant’s administrative employees;

THAT each member shall have the costs associated with attendance at one conference of their choice each year paid by the municipality, including hotel, transportation, registration and meal costs (not including alcohol);

AND THAT the enacting by-law be presented for Council’s consideration.
