Nestled in the heart of Hastings County lies the unique community of Centre Hastings with a population of 4,453 residents spread out over 222 sq. km. In 1998 the Urban (Madoc Village) and the Rural (Huntingdon Township) amalgamated to form the Municipality of Centre Hastings. 
 Welcome to Centre Hastings CivicWeb portal! Our community prides itself on strong, long running traditions. One of these traditions is getting our community engaged with what is going on at city hall. We are pleased to introduce our CivicWeb portal, which enables our citizens to learn about meetings, search for documents, view reports, and more! Let us know about how our community can be improved!
 Disclaimer
The Municipality of Centre Hastings documents contained in this system are for information purposes only. To verify the accuracy and currency of this information please contact the Municipality of Centre Hastings at 613-473-4030.

