  Members can declare now or at any time during the meeting.
5.
CLOSED MEETING 
  BE IT RESOLVED THAT the Council-Elect move into Closed Session at TIME, pursuant to Section 239 (3.1) for the purpose of educating or training the members; and
THAT the required staff and the Integrity Commissioner, J. Mascarin remain in attendance. 
BE IT RESOLVED THAT Council return to open session at TIME. 
