to By-law 050-06 
“Large Sign By-Law” 
 
 
d) 
Any billboard sign, ground sign, roof sign or development sign removed 
pursuant to this Section may be deposited on the property on which or in front of 
which it was located or removed. 
 
e) 
Any notice given under this by-law may be given by ordinary mail or personal 
