  THE CORPORATION OF THE MUNICIPALITY OF KINCARDINE
COUNCIL AGENDA
Wednesday, May 15, 2019
Council Chambers, Municipal Administration Centre
1.
Call to Order
 The Special Meeting of the Council of The Corporation of the Municipality of Kincardine will be called to Order at 9:30 a.m. on Wednesday May 15, 2019, in the Council Chambers at the Municipal Administration Centre.
The special meeting was called for the purpose of educating or training the members on Insurance/Risk Management. 
2.
Disclosure of Pecuniary Interest and the General Nature Thereof
 3.
Business for Which the Special Meeting is Called
 3.1
Move into Closed Meeting
