Cross Cemetery Grant Request
 Recommendation:
That the Committee of the Whole recommend that Council approve the request from Cross Cemetery for funding in the amount of up to $10,000 to construct a concrete path from the Cross Cemetery Road Allowance to the entrance of Cross Cemetery; and
That the Committee of the Whole recommend that Council provide an exception from the Cemetery Grant Policy to allow the proposed concrete pathway in the Township right of way to be eligible for up to $5,000 from the Cemetery Grant Fund; and
That the Committee of the Whole recommend that Council approve the allocation of up to $5,000 in approved funding from the Community Improvement Plan Accessibility Initiative to fund the request; and
That the Committee of the Whole recommends that Council directs staff to prepare a funding agreement for the CIP request to be executed by the Mayor and Clerk; and
That the Committee of the Whole recommends that Council direct staff to bring forward a by-law and an encroachment agreement with Cross Cemetery to authorize the location of the walkway for the cemetery to be located in the Township Road allowance.
