THE CORPORATION OF THE TOWN OF MIDLAND 
 
BY-LAW 2026-14 
 
A By-law to provide rules governing the proceedings of its Council, Council Committees, and its 
Members’ Conduct and to repeal By-law 2022-2, as amended. 
 
WHEREAS Section 238 (2) of the Municipal Act, 2001, S.O. 2001, c. 25 (“Municipal Act, 2001”) 
provides that a Council shall adopt a procedure by-law governing the calling and location of 
meetings, and meeting procedures; 
 
AND WHEREAS Section 238 (2.1) of the Municipal Act, 2001, S.O. 2001, c. 25, requires that 
the procedure by-law shall provide for public notice of meetings; 
 
AND WHEREAS Council has reviewed By-law 2022-2, as amended, and now deems it 
expedient to establish new provisions that reflect current legislative requirements and best 
practices; 
 
NOW THEREFORE THE COUNCIL OF THE CORPORATION OF THE TOWN OF MIDLAND 
