Welcome to our CivicWeb Portal! This new portal enables our residents to learn more about meetings, search and view minutes, agendas and all agenda documents. 

To find Meeting Agendas, Minutes and Council Information Packages (CIP), please visit the Meetings section of the portal. 

For previous Council Information Packages (prior to August 30, 2024) please visit the Archives at Document Center.

Watch Council Meetings live  
Regular Meetings of Council are scheduled for 2:00 pm every three weeks, on Wednesdays. Residents can watch Council meetings live on the Town’s official YouTube channel, with recordings posted afterward for future viewing. Rogers TV Midland Channel 53 also broadcasts and livestreams (Rogers Live Stream) each Regular Meeting of Council, subject to scheduling availability. 
