Welcome to the Township of Muskoka Lakes Government Portal! Here you can access information about your Council and Committee meetings. 
 Live Webcasting
 When a meeting is in session, click the LIVE STREAM icon below to access live video.

  General
 All Regular and Special meetings of Council, General Finance Committee, Planning Committee, Committee of the Whole and Committee of Adjustment are being live streamed and recorded on the Township of Muskoka website and YouTube channel. Information on public participation can be found in the specific meeting agenda.
 When in a meeting in Council Chambers, you will enter an area where photography, audio, and video recording may occur.  By entering the meeting room, you consent to such recording media and its release, publication, or reproduction.
 A closed session meeting of Council or Committee is regarded as confidential and will not be recorded or live streamed. The official record of all meetings shall be the written minutes in accordance with section 228(1) of the Municipal Act. The live stream files and recordings will be archived to the Township’s website for a period consistent with the Township's Records Retention By-Law.
 Public Notice - By attending a public meeting of Council/Committee, you are consenting to your image, voice and comments being recorded. Anyone who is invited to speak will be recorded and their voice, image and comments will form part of the live stream and recording.
