1.
Notice
 This meeting will be held in person only at Old Town Hall (460 Botsford Street, Newmarket). 

All property and business owners located within the Main Street District Business Improvement Area (BIA) boundaries are invited to an Annual General Meeting (AGM) where your current Board of Management will provide an overview of recent activities and seek members input into planned 2027 initiatives. 

Nominations for the Board of Management will also be held at this meeting for the purpose of selecting eight (8) nominees for consideration by Council of the Town of Newmarket for the appointment to the Newmarket Main Street District BIA Board of Management in the 2026-2030 Term of Council.

The following reference materials and forms are available using the links below:

Tenant Declaration Form

Corporate Assignment Form

Candidate Nomination Form

Main Street Business Improvement Area (BIA) Board Nominations Frequently Asked Questions (Note: this item is attached to the agenda).
2.
7:00 PM to 7:30 PM - Nomination Registration
 Note: Interested members are encouraged to register in advance by emailing clerks@newmarket.ca
3.
7:30 PM - Welcome and Introductions
 4.
Approval of Minutes
 4.1
Main Street District Business Improvement Area Annual General Meeting Minutes of November 19, 2025
  That the Main Street District Business Improvement Area Annual General Meeting Minutes of November 19, 2025 be approved. 
5.
2025 Financial Statements
  Note: Dominic Pede, Treasurer will speak to this item.
That the Main Street District Business Improvement Area Financial Statements for the year end 2025 be approved. 
6.
2025 Review
 Note: Tom Hempen, Chair will speak to this item.
That the 2025 Review verbal update provided by Tom Hempen, Chair be received. 
7.
2027 Budget
  That the 2027 Main Street District Business Improvement Area Board of Management Budget be approved. 
8.
Election of the 2026 - 2030 Board of Management
  Current Nominees: Introduction of Candidates
Additions and Deletions to nominees
9.
Adjournment
