Mr. Robert Krauss, applicant, and Mr. Brad Deming, agent, were in attendance 
representing the application.  
Ms. Amy Hartley, Development Planner, provided an overview of the application as 
contained within Report CP 2025-281. She advised that the application proposes 
removal of the existing detached garage and construction of a new detached structure 
containing both personal storage space/garage area and an Additional Residential Unit 
(ARU). The applicant has indicated that the garage space will be used for personal 
storage, for a motorhome which requires relief of height restrictions. She further 

 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
  
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
  
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
  
 
 
 
 
 
 
  
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
