The Township of Otonabee-South Monaghan is committed to maintaining open communication with citizens in order to achieve a positively engaged community. One way to achieve this is by keeping citizens well informed about the decisions of Council. We are pleased to introduce our CivicWeb portal.  The portal increases transparency by enabling our citizens to learn about meetings, search for documents, view reports, and more!  
 Within our Portal, you can:
Search for documents in our online library
Subscribe to meetings that interest you
View upcoming and past meetings using the Calendar
Review agendas and minutes within the Meeting area
View our Help area for tutorials on using and navigating our portal.
