Home
Welcome to our Portal! The Township of Perth South prides itself on strong, long running traditions. One of these traditions is getting our community engaged with what is going on at the Township Office. We are pleased to introduce our Portal. The portal increases transparency by enabling our citizens to learn about meetings, search for documents, view reports, and more!
 Within our Portal, you can:
Search for documents in our online library
Subscribe to meetings that interest you
view upcoming and past meetings using the Calendar
review agendas and minutes within the Meeting area
The Council Chambers at the Township Office are open to the public to attend Council meetings.  Council meetings are also livestreamed on the Township of Perth South YouTube channel.
