 Prepared by: Denis Turcot, CAO
Recommended Resolution
BE IT RESOLVED THAT Council approves the proposal submitted by EXP Services Inc., dated October 7, 2026, for a Desktop Review of Groundwater Quantity Conditions within the Village of St.-Charles, in the amount of $6,670.00 plus applicable HST;
AND BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED THAT Council authorizes the use of general reserves to an upset limit of $6,670.00 plus applicable HST toward this project.
AND BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED THAT Council further authorizes an additional $1,300.00 plus applicable HST for one site visit and consultation with affected residents.
