AND THAT a Noise Notification Agreement be registered on title to the satisfaction of Planning Services on the subject lands to notify all prospective tenants or purchasers that noise and/or vibration may interfere with some of the occupant’s activities and outlining the mitigation measures that have been taken or those required;
