Thunder Bay Hydro Corporation Dividend Policy
This item has Video
 
Report 305-2026-Corporate Services-Finance providing a recommendation relative to the allocation of dividend proceeds, for Council's consideration.
WITH RESPECT to Report 305-2026-Corporate Services-Finance, we recommend that the dividend proceeds received in 2026 from Thunder Bay Hydro Corporation (TBHC), totaling $383,014, be transferred to the Capital General Reserve Fund for allocation through the Capital Budget process;
AND THAT future Regular, Performance, and Special Dividends received from TBHC be transferred to the Capital General Reserve Fund to support subsequent years' Capital Budgets;
AND THAT any necessary by-laws be presented to City Council for ratification.
