WITH RESPECT to Report 317-2026-Corporate Services-Finance, we recommend the appointment of the firm of MNP LLP as auditors for the City of Thunder Bay and its local boards for a five-year period effective January 1, 2026 (commencing with the December 31, 2026 year-end process);
AND THAT the Mayor and Clerk be authorized to execute all required documentation relative to auditor appointment including any supplementary agreements;
AND THAT any necessary by-laws be presented to City Council for ratification.

