WITH RESPECT to Report 353-2026 (City Manager’s Office – Office of the City Clerk), we recommend that the At-large Council seat of Councillor Shelby Ch’ng be declared vacant pursuant to and in accordance with Sections 262 and 259(1) of the Municipal Act;
