11.4
Bill 140 - Building Ontario Faster Act
 THAT Council of the Town of Tillsonburg supports AMO Policy Director Karen Nesbitt's remarks to the Standing Committee on the Interior regarding AMO's position on Bill 140, the Building Ontario Faster Act;
AND THAT Council specifically supports AMO's position that achieving Ontario's building goals means respecting municipal decision-making and ensuring municipalities have a meaningful voice in shaping their communities;
AND THAT Council recognizes and supports the joint press release issued by the Municipalities of Oxford County on November 2, 2026 regarding Ontario's proposed actions to address landfill capacity and highlights from that release Council's support of municipalities retaining the ability to decide whether to accept a landfill in their communities.
AND FURTHER THAT Council directs the Clerk to send this resolution supporting AMO's position on Bill 140 to Minister Lecce and copy MPP Ernie Hardeman and ERTH Power Corporation.
