 A By-law to appoint a Member of Council as an Alternate Member of Hastings County Council, to act in place of the Mayor of the Municipality of Tweed who is a Member of Hastings County Council when Mayor Jamie DeMarsh is unable to attend a meeting of Hastings County Council, or meetings of the Finance, Property & Personnel Committee and Planning and Development Committee, for any reason.
