 Applicant: The Corporation of the Municipality of Tweed
Location : Municipality Wide (Rural and Prime Agriculture zones).
Purpose: The Municipality of Tweed is undertaking an Administrative Amendment to the Comprehensive Zoning By-Law No. 2012-30 to amend Section 5.25.2, Accessory Buildings, by revising the subsection to permit the construction of an accessory building in the exterior side yard and front yard, but not within the required exterior side yard and front yard setbacks for the Rural (RU) Zone and Prime Agriculture (PA) Zone. The effect will be to broaden the area within the Rural (RU) Zone and Prime Agriculture (PA) Zone where an accessory building may be placed while respecting the setback distances of the zone classification.
