come together.  A place of empowerment, for creativity,  
innovation and learning.  
Our Values 
Promote literacy Inspire creativity, innovation and lifelong 
learning Ensure inclusivity, accessibility and diversity engage     
our community Accountability Centre for research Excellent 
Service  
 
  
 
 
 
Inclement Weather: In the event of extenuating weather  
conditions that may affect public safety,               
the Bonfield Public Library will remain closed 
  
