FROM 
Réjean Raymond, Chief Administrative Officer & Clerk 
DATE 
October 22, 2026 
SUBJECT 
Award of RFT 2026-10-PW-01 Asphalt Repairs (Amendment to Budget) 
Background
The Township issued Request for Tender (RFT) 2026-10-PW-01 for asphalt repairs at ten locations 
totalling 3,142.37 m². At each location, the contractor will grind 50 mm or remove the existing asphalt 
and replace it with 50 mm of Super Pave 12.5, PGAC 58-34 XJ. 
Tenders were accepted by email only, with a closing of Thursday, October 22, 2026, at 12:00 p.m. Three 
tenders were received before the closing time: 
Bidder 
Received 
