$362,653.07 
All three bidders quoted on every location and accepted all general requirements. 
Pioneer Construction Inc. submitted the lowest tender at $252,702.33 excluding HST, which is 
$64,749.93 lower than the next tender. Its price includes $29,975.00 for mobilization, with unit prices of 
$69.85/m² at the larger locations and $99.75/m² at Birch St, Pine St and Riverside Dr. 
If Council approves the award, the purchase order will be issued on October 23, 2026, and the work 
must be completed by November 13, 2026, weather permitting. 
Financial Implications
With the Township's 1.76% net share of HST, the cost of the low tender is $257,149.89. The cost is split 
by location between the Water and Sewer Reserve Funds and Public Works: 
