REQUEST FOR TENDER 2026-10-PW-01 FOR 
ASPHALT REPAIRS 
The Township of Chapleau wants to repair sections of asphalt at different locations in town and 
on Fox Lake Rd. 
Quotations are hereby requested for one asphalt repair project. All purchases are subject to 
Council budget approval. 
Quotations must be submitted on the attached proposal form by email only to the undersigned 
by the following deadline: 
Closing Date: Thursday, October 22, 2026, at 12:00 p.m. (noon) 
Email submissions to: cao@chapleau.ca  
Subject line: RFT 2026-10-PW-01 Asphalt Repairs 
Mail, courier, hand delivered and faxed submissions will not be accepted. Submissions received 
after the closing time will not be considered. The Township is not responsible for emails that are 
delayed, blocked or not received. 
Quotations will be opened after the closing time. Results will be available upon request. 
INQUIRIES REGARDING RFT 
All inquiries relative to this RFT shall be directed to Jeff Sisson, Public Works Manager, at 
jsisson@chapleau.ca or (705) 870-1334. 
No information provided orally by the Township shall be binding, nor shall it alter the 
requirements in any way. 
INFORMATION TO BIDDERS 
1. The RFT must list mobilization and the asphalt repair project separately, with a unit price per 
square metre and the grand total without HST. 
2. Prices quoted shall remain firm and open to acceptance for thirty (30) days after the closing 
date unless otherwise stated. 
3. The successful bidder will receive the purchase order on October 23, 2026, following 
Council approval. 
4. The successful bidder must complete all the work no later than November 13, 2026, weather 
permitting. 
5. The successful bidder must warranty the work and asphalt quality. 
6. Payment in full will be made within thirty (30) days of receipt of the invoice. 
7. The Township of Chapleau reserves the right, privilege, entitlement and absolute discretion, 
and for any reason whatsoever to: 
• 
accept a Proposal which is not the one with the lowest cost; 
• 
reject a Proposal, even if it is the one with the lowest cost; 
• 
reject a Proposal even if it is the only Proposal received; 
