at the sampling location; 
• The minimum, maximum and average daily flows and total monthly flow for the sample 
location for the month being reported on; 
• The monthly effluent loading for parameters BOD5, Total Suspended Solids and Total 
Phosphorus from the final effluent shall be reported in kilograms. 
