     That the BDO 2025 Audit of the Canada Community-Building Fund be   
     accepted as presented. 
     Carried. 
 
     Moved by Councillor Krall 
     Seconded by Councillor Burke 
That Council receive the 2026 Annual Asset Management Review      
Memorandum for information; And that Administration use the findings to 
guide development of a rolling multi-year capital plan and annual asset 
