    That third and final reading be given to By-law 53 of 2026. 
  
    Carried. 
 
H.      Adjournment 
 
   Moved by Councillor Van Dun 
   Seconded by Councillor Williams 
   That the meeting adjourn. 
   Carried. 
 
 
 
