Handbook / Code of Conduct Rules.
Discussion:
We have had a few issues with our previous campground rules and regulations. Staff
reviewed various campground rules and would like to implement the new rules and
regulations for the 2027 camping season.
This will give Campground staff a clearer understanding and hopefully make their job
supervising the park less stressful.
Staff will be redesigning the Camp Ground Reservation forms for the various types of
camping. (seasonal, monthly, weekly, transient and group camping.)
Financial lmplications:
