The Township of Dawn-Euphemia provides the following level of service during
the winter maintenance season, as set out in 3.3.0, in response to a winter event.
Weather Monitoring
3.2.1 (1) From October 1 to April 30, the minimum standard is to monitor the weather,
both current and forecast to occur in the next 24 hours, once every shift or
three times per calendar day, whichever is more frequent, at intervals
determined bY the MuniciPalitY.
(2) From May 1 to September 30, the minimum standard is to monitor the
weather, both current and forecast to occur in the next 24 hours, once per
calendar daY.
