• 
Phone number of member 
• 
Contact information for the Board Administrator 
 
 
 As a reminder, the Community Safety and Policing Act requires Detachment Boards to meet 
at least four times per calendar year. Municipalities must ensure this occurs. 
Should you have any questions, feel free to contact me 
 
Respectfully  
Ron LeClair 
 
 
 
 
 

  
 
 
 
 
 
 
