Housing Services - Update 
The Director of Housing Services reported on the application status for 
units at 44 Third Ave, Wawa and 84 Indiana Ave, Blind River.  The public 
was notified applications were being accepted through an aggressive 
advertising campaign via radio, newspaper, municipalities, billboard sign.  
20 unique applications for Wawa were received and 24 unique 
applications for Blind River. 
