7.4.1 Paramedic Services - Call Volume Report - Q1 2026 
The Chief of Paramedic Services provided an overview of the Call 
Volume Report for the first quarter. 
7.4.2 Paramedic Services - Response Time Performance - Q1 2026 
The Chief of Paramedic Services noted that Algoma District Paramedic 
Services is meeting its Response Time targets, except for the Sudden 
Cardiac Arrest category.  It was noted that due to factors such as 
ADSAB’s geographic area and distance, weather, calls during on-call 
coverage, the target response time may not be achievable.  
