Seconded by Harold Lavigne 
THAT By-Law No. 59 – 2026 Being a by-law to confirm the proceedings of Council of the 
Township of Killaloe, Hagarty and Richards at its Regular Council meeting and Public Meeting 
held on October 20, 2026 be given its 1st, 2nd and 3rd reading and finally passed this 20th 
day of October, 2026.    Carried. 
