PRESENT 
Mayor absent, Councillors: K Cottam, N Gate, W Lundgren (took the chair as Head of Council for the 
meeting) and B Pentney. Clerk-Treasurer: P W Giles, Rd Supt absent, Kim Hannam speaking in 
support of their minor variance application.  
