Land Acknowledgement Statement 
 
 
 
We begin this meeting of Council by acknowledging that we are on 
traditional territory of the Haudenosaunee (Hoe-den-oh-show-nee) and 
Anishinabe (A-nish-in-‘a-bay) and First Peoples. We do so respecting both 
the land and the Indigenous People who continue to walk with us through 
this world. 
 
We are grateful for the opportunity to gather here.  
 
In recognition of the contributions and importance of all Indigenous 
Peoples, we strongly support Truth and Reconciliation Calls to Action in our 
nation and commit to support local endeavors where possible. 
 
 

Call for Nominations – Deputy Mayor 
 
Council passed By-law No. 2022-133, being a By-law to amend the Procedural 
By-law to replace the definition of Deputy Mayor, which states, “Deputy Mayor 
means a person appointed by Council, during its first regular meeting following a 
municipal election, to hold the seat of Deputy Mayor for a four (4) year term”  
 
Tonight, a Call for Nominations and subsequently a voting process will take place 
to appoint a member of Council to the position of Deputy Mayor for the period of 
November 18, 2026, to November 14, 2030. 
 
The process for the appointment of Deputy Mayor will be as follows: 
 
1. The Clerk will open the floor and call for nominations from the Council 
members present; 
2. Once a nominee has been named, the Clerk will call for a seconder; 
3. The nominee will be asked if he/she accepts the nomination. 
4. This process will continue until no further nominations have been put forward. 
 
The Voting Process: 
1. The order in which the nominations were presented will be the same when 
calling the vote. 
2. The votes will be taken by the raising of hands.  Please do not lower your 
hand until the count has been confirmed. 
3. The Deputy Mayor shall be appointed by the most “in-favour” votes.   
4. Should there be a tie, the names of the nominees will be placed in a hat, and 
the CAO will draw the name.  
 
I will now open the floor for nominations for the position of Deputy Mayor. 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 

