Dear Mayor MacNevin:
Thank you for the continued interest in the Northern Ontario Resource Development Support
(NORDS) Fund. We recognize the importance of investing in infrastructure to enable resource
development, and to help communities maintain and enhance their community assets as
development sectors, including forestry, mining, aggregates and agriculture, continue to drive
economic growth and Prosperity.
I am pleased to inform you that the Township of Northeastern Manitoulin & The lslands is
approved to apply its Year 1 allocation to the Road Resurfacing project to help advance economic
opportunities for your community.
You should anticipate the Year 1 NORDS Fund allocation payment of $129,706.34 within 30 days.
lf you have any questions related to the NORDS Fund, please contact ministry staff at
nords@ontario.ca.
I commend your commitment to improving local infrastructure and continued collaboration with
municipalities across northern Ontario. We are committed to working with you as we continue to
develop increased prosperity and growth and I look forward to jointly announcing this project with
you at a later date.
Sincerely,
The Honourable George Pirie
Minister of Northern Economic Development and Growth
