the funding agency have been reimbursed. 
• GICB: We are awaiting an agreement with this agency. 
• 
Health and Safety: Department heads met on September 8, 2026 to review the Working 
Alone Policy and the accompanying risk assessment that will need to be completed. Each 
department will have different risk levels, therefore it is critical to create the assessment for 
each one. 
• 
It was also agreed that regular meetings be held to support ongoing improvements regarding 
our written policies, procedures and actions regarding health and safety. 
Treasurer's Report 
• 
Monthly remittances have been completed, including Receiver General, OMERS, and other 
required payments. 
• The August Budget-to-Actual report will be provided under separate cover. 
Respectfully submitted, 
~ 
Janet Boucher, Deputy Clerk/Treasurer 
