up to and including August 04th, 2026, be given a FIRST, SECOND, and THIRD READING, and 
FINALLY Passed this 04th day of August 2026. (Carried) 
 
 10.   Adjournment. 
Resolution 2026-166 
Moved by: Councillor T. Trutenko 
 
 
Seconded by: Councillor M. Christenson 
 
