Recycling tips
Flatten cardboard to save space. 
Place containers clean, dry and loose. 
Lids and labels can remain on containers and cans. Remove lids
from glass containers and coffee cups. 
Safely dispose of batteries, sharps and propane canisters at a
designated dropoff location. 
Place bins away from snowbanks, sidewalks and obstacles. 
Place recycling at the curb by 7 a.m.
