Water Sample Testing
Residents submitting private drinking water
samples can complete their information online
through the Public Health Ontario Water
Testing Portal or use the paper form provided
with their water testing kit.
Drop-off Location:
Lorraine’s Pharmasave, Barry’s Bay, or any
other designated water sample drop-off
location.
Please select Renfrew County and District
Health Unit as your health unit on the
submission form.
Drop-off Times:
September – April: Tuesdays before 2:00
p.m.
May – August: Tuesdays and Thursdays
before 2:00 p.m.
Important: Water samples must be tested
within 48 hours of collection. Collect your
sample as close to drop-off time as possible
and keep it cool, but not frozen.
