confirmed. 
 
4. All other proceedings, decisions, and directives of the Council of the Corporation of 
the Municipality of Val Rita Harty during the period mentioned in Section 1 are 
hereby ratified and confirmed. 
 
5. This Bylaw takes effect on the day of its final passing. 
 
 
